ddle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pv9r3H0z\">advertiser_id<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-xJP4UZIT\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-b0MB7i4d\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-Fd6vZu5M\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-syioPM8c\">客户ID</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-DSZucdpL\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-Ntz5Mirv\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1rs2ZEkD\">label_ids<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-UwDf9HHZ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kqM7wSGY\">number[]</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-ZMj5aioI\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UIV44VrG\">抖音号id列表，取值大小：1～50；label_id即计划中设置的抖音达人账号的id</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-rtbYocSg\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-Z2LN7lCv\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-wo